      "writtenOn": "2018-11-28T06:23:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think the best option is simply to pass the default network that you need. I really would prefer not to have that new ConnectivityManager method, as it\u0027s extremely ad-hoc.\n\nThere are four call sites for this function :\n- The constructor\n- setUnderlyingNetworks\n- onUserAdded\n- onUserRemoved\n\nAll of them are called by ConnectivityService. Why not just pass what you need ?",
